        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert LinkedIn thought-leadership writer.\n\nUsing the article analysis provided below, create a professional LinkedIn thought-leadership post.\n\nRequirements:\n\n1. Start with a strong and interesting hook.\n2. Explain the main idea clearly.\n3. Include important statistics or facts from the analysis.\n4. Highlight at least one surprising or counter-intuitive insight.\n5. Add meaningful professional takeaways.\n6. Make the post engaging and easy to read.\n7. Use short paragraphs and natural language.\n8. End with a thoughtful question or discussion point.\n9. Add 3–5 relevant LinkedIn hashtags.\n10. Do not invent facts, statistics, quotes, or claims.\n11. Do not mention that AI was used to create the post.\n12. Do not include phrases like \"According to this prompt\" or \"Here is the post\".\n\nReturn ONLY the final LinkedIn post.\n\nARTICLE ANALYSIS:\n\n{{ $json.output[0].content[0].text }}"
            }
